 landlord banned after 16 children suffer lead poisoning in his properties]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136067545.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Due to alarming lead poisoning cases affecting minors, William D'Angelo has been compelled to sell his rental properties. His noncompliance with safety regulations has triggered serious intervention from state authorities. The Attorney General's Office has pinpointed numerous violations regarding unsafe lead paint situations. Future owners must obtain approval and quickly remediate any lead threats. D'Angelo is at risk of hefty fines and further legal issues if his violations persist.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-least-16-children-suffered-lead-poisoning-in-homes-owned-by-a-new-york-landlord-after-he-failed-to-obey-a-310000-court-settlement-to-remove-the-hazards-the-state-has-permanently-banned-him-from-renting-properties/articleshow/136067545.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-least-16-children-suffered-lead-poisoning-in-homes-owned-by-a-new-york-landlord-after-he-failed-to-obey-a-310000-court-settlement-to-remove-the-hazards-the-state-has-permanently-banned-him-from-renting-properties/articleshow/136067545.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T07:05:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136067574,imgsize-995674.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cameraman Wins $44,000: Salameh gives mother GTA 6 winnings; survives 60-minute robbery mission]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136085487.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[MrBeast challenged his longtime cameraman, Tareq Salameh, to steal as much money as possible in GTA 6 within 60 minutes, promising real cash for every dollar earned. Despite losing his initial winnings after being killed, Salameh rebuilt his balance and completed a dramatic airport escape. He ultimately secured approximately $44,000 for his mother, turning the gaming challenge into an emotional surprise.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/mrbeast-promises-real-money-for-every-dollar-stolen-in-gta-6-as-cameraman-wins-44000-for-his-mother/articleshow/136085487.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/mrbeast-promises-real-money-for-every-dollar-stolen-in-gta-6-as-cameraman-wins-44000-for-his-mother/articleshow/136085487.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T05:31:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136085492,imgsize-27634.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: Russian warship bursts into flames in suspected Ukraine drone attack in Libya]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136085577.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A suspected Ukrainian sea drone attack targeted a Russian warship at the Benghazi port, causing significant damage. Reports indicate that two drones successfully struck the corvette Merkury while it was docked to refuel. Libyan officials confirmed the incident and conducted an investigation into the attack's origin. Additionally, another drone attack occurred on a Malta-flagged commercial vessel off the coast.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/watch-russian-warship-hit-by-suspected-ukrainian-drones-at-benghazi-naval-base-bursts-into-flames/articleshow/136085577.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/watch-russian-warship-hit-by-suspected-ukrainian-drones-at-benghazi-naval-base-bursts-into-flames/articleshow/136085577.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T04:51:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136085591,imgsize-11792616.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Wife's support during husband's medical training becomes key in divorce asset battle]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136075201.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[An Alabama appeals court reversed a divorce property settlement after finding that a lower court wrongly excluded a surgeon's medical-business interests, acquired during his marriage, from marital assets. His wife had supported the household while he completed medical training. The case has been sent back for a fresh valuation and division of the couple's property.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-alabama-woman-supported-her-husband-while-he-trained-as-a-surgeon-but-their-divorce-excluded-his-medical-business-interests-from-marital-assets-an-appeals-court-reversed-that-division-and-ordered-a-new-review/articleshow/136075201.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-alabama-woman-supported-her-husband-while-he-trained-as-a-surgeon-but-their-divorce-excluded-his-medical-business-interests-from-marital-assets-an-appeals-court-reversed-that-division-and-ordered-a-new-review/articleshow/136075201.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-22T19:56:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136075865,imgsize-92540.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Could IShowSpeed have a future beyond YouTube? Usain Bolt weighs in after surprising 100m performance]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136082985.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a thrilling showdown, IShowSpeed took on legendary sprinter Usain Bolt in a 100-meter race, finishing with a time of 10.352 seconds, as showcased in a captivating YouTube video on November 22, 2026. Although his achievement doesn't eclipse Bolt's remarkable world record, it certainly highlights Speed's untapped potential in sprinting. Bolt himself noted Speed's capability, igniting discussions about his possible future in the world of professional athletics.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/could-ishowspeed-have-a-future-beyond-youtube-usain-bolt-weighs-in-after-surprising-100m-performance/articleshow/136082985.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/could-ishowspeed-have-a-future-beyond-youtube-usain-bolt-weighs-in-after-surprising-100m-performance/articleshow/136082985.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T01:16:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136083000,imgsize-1448558.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kick streamer CostaKid sparks controversy after attacking woman in viral livestream clip]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136083234.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[CostaKid, a 20-year-old streamer, has found himself at the center of controversy following a livestream incident. While broadcasting, a woman unexpectedly doused him with water, prompting an alarming reaction from CostaKid. His violent backlash included spitting, hair-pulling, and physical attacks. Onlookers urged him to cease his aggression, escalating the focus on his previous legal challenges and possible repercussions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/kick-streamer-costakid-sparks-controversy-after-attacking-woman-in-viral-livestream-clip/articleshow/136083234.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/kick-streamer-costakid-sparks-controversy-after-attacking-woman-in-viral-livestream-clip/articleshow/136083234.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T01:57:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136083238,imgsize-829806.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why did a small GTA 6 streamer break down in tears after Ibai Llanos joined his Twitch stream?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136083465.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Dicrim_RD69 saw a remarkable surge in viewership after the popular streamer Ibai Llanos featured him during a GTA 6 livestream. What started as a nearly empty stream transformed into a bustling hub of activity, drawing in fans thanks to Ibai's influence. Overwhelmed with gratitude, Dicrim opened up about his earlier struggles in streaming, demonstrating how even a simple gesture of support can profoundly affect a creator's path.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/why-did-a-small-gta-6-streamer-break-down-in-tears-after-ibai-llanos-joined-his-twitch-stream/articleshow/136083465.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/why-did-a-small-gta-6-streamer-break-down-in-tears-after-ibai-llanos-joined-his-twitch-stream/articleshow/136083465.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-23T02:40:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/